Subject: [PATCH 197/257] tools: fix A3 focused-leg interpreter and add native
 suite rerun

The shared c8 env has no pytest; the window now prefers a
system-site-packages venv under the evidence root, and the failed first
suite leg is re-run by run_native_suites.sh with the recorded fix.
---
 tools/sve256_liveness_evidence/run_a3_window.sh     |  6 +++++-
 tools/sve256_liveness_evidence/run_native_suites.sh | 38 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 43 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tools/sve256_liveness_evidence/run_a3_window.sh b/tools/sve256_liveness_evidence/run_a3_window.sh
index b373299b1..7856d6360 100755
--- a/tools/sve256_liveness_evidence/run_a3_window.sh
+++ b/tools/sve256_liveness_evidence/run_a3_window.sh
@@ -17,7 +17,11 @@
 set -u
 
 ROOT="$(cd "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")" && pwd)"
-PY="${HOME}/pypto-x-a3/envs/pypto-x-c8/bin/python"
+if [[ -x "${ROOT}/venv/bin/python" ]]; then
+  PY="${ROOT}/venv/bin/python"
+else
+  PY="${HOME}/pypto-x-a3/envs/pypto-x-c8/bin/python"
+fi
 DRIVER="${ROOT}/src/python/tests/ut/pypto_x/qwen35_weighted_execution_driver.py"
 ASSET="${HOME}/models/Qwen3.5-0.8B"
